rds being featured  after being activated we are contacted  by Astrid Maya the acting section chief  for Laura Manhattan  she gives a rundown of the current  situation and tells us to meet up with  agent Kelly and rescue a VIP Angela Chan  we find them both at the Spring Blossom  Restaurant but she is refusing to leave  without her people  the agents agree to help all of them and  escort them to a nearby checkpoint  the agents move out ahead to clear a  path and make sure that it is safe for  civilians the plan is to meet up with  the jtf at the Manhattan Bridge  checkpoint however Maya releases an  update to all agents over the comms  to all agents be advised that the jtf  has lost control of several checkpoints  across Midtown we now have bad guys  operating with impunity in some areas  be careful  the agents called through to Chang  telling you that the path between them  is clear  once at the checkpoint agent Kelly  suddenly receives a call from a doctor  O'Neill at the Trinity Church field  hospital they are being overrun and need  help  grabbing a helicopter and a handful of  jtf officers the agents make their way  over there  flying above the buildings it was easy  to see the true damage to the city due  to the collapse  suddenly a rocket is fired at them from  one of the buildings below and then  another  the second Clips them sending them into  a spin but as the agents are now close  enough to the building they make a jump  and land on the roof as the helicopter  loses control crashing into the  buildings below  fighting their way through they come  across a heavily wounded jdf officer  he informs them that the hostiles had  overrun them and had taken all of their  support weapons heavy weapons  a mistake by the jtf why would they  bring these into the city the enemy is  now heavily armed  Maya asked the jtf commander about these  weapons but the order to bring them in  didn't come from him  the hostiles were headed to the stock  exchange and as it turns ou