id this before I'm not a mobile  gamer by any means and I know that this  isn't what a lot of people are after but  I'm legitimately looking forward to this  I certainly don't plan on playing this  like a typical mobile game though I will  100 be using a controller or better yet  an emulator on PC remember the teams  working on this have absolutely no  impact on the other games these are  completely different Talent pools  But like everyone else I too would like  more content for the division 2 or even  a division three but for now this is  looking good to supplement the  increasing gaps between content drops in  the main game  plus if the Resurgence team is able to  keep their plan of releasing updates  every three months there's going to be a  lot to keep up with  I'm someone who loves the division  universe and the story behind it maybe  more than I like the game some days so  anything that continues to feed into it  whether it be games novels audiobooks or  even Comics to a lesser extent I'm all  for it  even though we've really only seen a  small snippet of what the resurgent  story is like so far there is already  more information coming through around  what it was like before the jtf had  completely lost control and pulled out  of the area so I'm looking forward to  learning more about the space within the  overall timeline  a big thank you again to abrex and  extremist Moss extremely remedia  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  oh  [Music]

